、再这样下去就要迟到了！"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_magical_girl_CoopHurryUp"]},{"type":"CoopBelieve","label":"战斗-信任","texts":{"zhCN":["呜哇…我会想办法解决的！"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_magical_girl_CoopBelieve"]},{"type":"TouchReactionGood1","label":"触碰反应-积极1","texts":{"zhCN":["摸摸小柴琳，难道不开心吗？"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["Voice_magical_girl_1_TouchReactionGood1","cv_magical_girl_TouchReactionGood1"]},{"type":"TouchReactionGood2","label":"触碰反应-积极2","texts":{"zhCN":["等、等一下！那边好像在讨论魔法少女…要不要偷偷听一下？"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["Voice_magical_girl_1_TouchReactionGood2","cv_magical_girl_TouchReactionGood2"]},{"type":"TouchReactionBad1","label":"触碰反应-消极1","texts":{"zhCN":["呀！我、我花了一小时才编好的头发，别碰…！"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["Voice_magical_girl_1_TouchReactionBad1","cv_magical_girl_TouchReactionBad1"]},{"type":"TouchReactionBad2","label":"触碰反应-消极2","texts":{"zhCN":["为什么一解除变身，我就没自信了呢？如果“神秘紫罗兰”是真正的我就好了…"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["Voice_magical_girl_1_TouchReactionBad2","cv_magical_girl_TouchReactionBad2"]},{"type":"NoticeMail","label":"邮件提示","texts":{"zhCN":["啊，是呼叫！有新敌人出现了吗？"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["Voice_magical_girl_1_NoticeMail","cv_magical_girl_NoticeMail"]},{"type":"NoticeEvent","label":"活动提示","texts":{"zhCN":["庆、庆典…！！心脏怦怦直跳，睡不着…"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_magical_girl_NoticeEvent"]},{"type":"SummonSpeech1","label":"召唤-台词1","texts":{"zhCN":["虽然有时会很辛苦，但能帮助到别人，我真的很开心。"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_magical_girl_SummonSpeech1"]},{"type":"SummonSpeech2","label":"召唤-台词2","texts":{"zhCN":["今后，我也要守护大家的梦想和希望。"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_magical_girl_SummonSpeech2"]},{"type":"SummonSpeech3","label":"召唤-台词3","texts":{"zhCN":["虽、虽然只是个普通的魔法少女，但请多多支持我…！"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_magical_girl_SummonSpeech3"]}]},{"id":"magical_girl_myth","label":"开花","lines":[{"type":"NormalBattleWin","label":"胜利-普通战斗","texts":{"zhCN":["嘿嘿，这是爱与正义的胜利！"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_magical_girl_myth_NormalBattleWin"]},{"type":"BossBattleWin","label":"胜利-首领战斗","te